      "Most people only think about their door jambs when something goes wrong: the bottom of the frame turns soft, the deadbolt stops lining up, or a kicked-in door splits the latch side. This guide walks through the parts of a door frame, how to recognize jamb rot, and when a repair makes sense versus a full exterior door jamb replacement.",
      "## Door Frame Parts, Named",
