      "### 3. Exterior door jamb replacement",
      "If rot runs up the jamb, reaches the sill, or the buck behind it is soft, the frame needs to come out. Some contractors can rebuild the frame around an existing slab, but for most exterior doors it is more practical to install a new prehung door so the frame, sill, weatherstripping and hardware all come as one tested unit.",
      "## Door Jamb Repair and Replacement Cost",
