      "- **Salt air:** near the coast, use stainless or coated fasteners and hinges, and keep paint on every exposed surface of the jamb, especially end grain.",
      "- **Grade and pavers:** if pavers or a patio have been raised to the threshold height, the jamb will keep rotting until water has somewhere else to go.",
      "If the frame is too far gone, our [impact window and door installation](/services/impact-windows-doors) team can replace the whole unit, and our [home restoration](/services/home-restoration) crews handle the buck, stucco and paint repairs around it.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions",
      "### What is the difference between a door jamb and a door frame?",
